OL,3,GNEWSAPublic tip-offs help track down
OL,4,AAsian hornet nests
OL,5,
OL,6,FIslanders are being urged to report any
OL,7,FAsian hornet nests as the government
OL,8,Flooks to "track down and remove them".
OL,10,FThe States of Guernsey said its Asian
OL,11,FHornets Team recently removed five
OL,12,Fsecondary nests in the space of a week,
OL,13,Ftaking the total number of nests taken
OL,14,Fdown in 2026 to 14.
OL,16,FThe government said, of the five nests
OL,17,Ffound, three were located due to public
OL,18,Ftip-offs.
OL,20,FAsian hornets are an invasive species
OL,21,Fand an aggressive predator of many
OL,22,Ftypes of insect, especially honey bees.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
